---
import Terminal from "./Terminal.astro";
---
<section class="band" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
  <div class="rail grid gap-12 px-5 py-20 sm:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.35fr] lg:items-center lg:gap-16">
    <div class="reveal flex flex-col gap-6">
      <p class="caption-3 font-mono text-faint">00 / Why nyq</p>
      <h2 id="problem-title" class="heading-4 sm:heading-3">
        Every model vendor ships its own agent, and each one wants your habits
      </h2>
      <p class="body-3 text-muted">
        One CLI for your ChatGPT plan, another for Grok, a third for your API key, and none of them
        talk to your local models. <span class="text-fg">nyq is one tool for all of them.</span> Press{" "}
        <kbd class="border border-line-strong bg-raised px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-fg">Ctrl+L</kbd>
        to switch model mid conversation; your sessions, permissions, skills and MCP servers stay put.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal min-w-0">
      <Terminal />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
